<p>
  A <a href="https://tiptap.dev">Tiptap</a> editor using Tiptap's own
  <code>Collaboration</code> and <code>CollaborationCursor</code>
  extensions. The shared state is the <code>Y.XmlFragment</code> that
  ProseMirror keeps its document in. Carets and selections travel over
  awareness, which the server relays and doesn't store.
</p>
<p>
  The editor is created after the first sync. Tiptap inserts an empty
  paragraph into the document when it mounts, so if you bind before the
  server's state arrives, every client adds its own competing top-level
  node.
</p>
